{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$n$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$f' : Y' \\times_Y X \\to Y'$", "MATH_0005": "$n$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-bounded}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:875baa5feb7fd361bd116f198d854007dc8f9ab5bfe89e648af7f8fb90184918", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:54a3d247ce067e63cb01f59fd687ba1a5ec74494e13a4a2e8f014367201247b1", "source_text": "A base change of a morphism with universally bounded fibres is\na morphism with universally bounded fibres. More precisely, if\n<MATH_0001> bounds the degrees of the fibres of <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003>\nis any morphism, then the degrees of the fibres of the base change\n<MATH_0004> is also bounded by <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8a9df410ec5aaa4d8d3961347d3edf22a7b2ada4ead15af42ddf9194c7b84d3f", "unit_id": "tag:03J7:statement"}
