{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f' : X' = X_{Y'} \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0006": "$f'$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$n$", "MATH_0009": "$f'$", "MATH_0010": "$n$", "MATH_0011": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descent-universally-bounded}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:402c7cffae2dcb8e726ba7382ef17148d270871178951a599c987d05b1298e00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:90b001f2f0732b4a59f814d23c86d4ce3652163eedc93d32835442194fc25278", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of schemes, and let\n<MATH_0003> be the base change of <MATH_0004>.\nIf <MATH_0005> is surjective and <MATH_0006> has universally bounded fibres,\nthen <MATH_0007> has universally bounded fibres. More precisely, if <MATH_0008> bounds\nthe degree of the fibres of <MATH_0009>, then also <MATH_0010> bounds the degrees\nof the fibres of <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d442042b1b37c4f3618dad4f38cfed610ea25da58a406676035a3ff4b789306f", "unit_id": "tag:03J8:statement"}
